# Input Validation Patterns Reference

This document provides a comprehensive reference for the validation patterns implemented in the secure Express.js application.

## Table of Contents
- [Basic Validations](#basic-validations)
- [String Validations](#string-validations)
- [Numeric Validations](#numeric-validations)
- [Email Validations](#email-validations)
- [Date Validations](#date-validations)
- [Array Validations](#array-validations)
- [Object Validations](#object-validations)
- [Custom Validations](#custom-validations)
- [Sanitization](#sanitization)
