## Array Validations

### Array Type
```javascript
body('tags')
  .isArray({ min: 1, max: 10 })
  .withMessage('Tags must be an array with 1-10 items')
```

### Array Item Validation
```javascript
body('emailList')
  .isArray()
  .withMessage('Email list must be an array')
  .custom((emails) => {
    for (const email of emails) {
      if (!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(email)) {
        throw new Error(`Invalid email format: ${email}`);
      }
    }
    return true;
  })
```

### Unique Array Items
```javascript
body('categories')
  .isArray()
  .custom((categories) => {
    const unique = new Set(categories);
    if (unique.size !== categories.length) {
      throw new Error('Categories must be unique');
    }
    return true;
  })
```

### Enum Values in Array
```javascript
const allowedStatuses = ['active', 'inactive', 'pending'];

body('statuses')
  .isArray()
  .withMessage('Statuses must be an array')
  .custom((statuses) => {
    const invalid = statuses.filter(s => !allowedStatuses.includes(s));
    if (invalid.length > 0) {
      throw new Error(`Invalid statuses: ${invalid.join(', ')}`);
    }
    return true;
  })
```

